top to bottom direction
class QuizController <<Java boundary>> {
+generate(body: QuizRequest): AcceptedQuiz
+accept(id: UUID, body: AcceptQuizRequest): QuizSummary
}
class QuizRequest <<DTO>> {
+selectedDocumentIds: UUID[1..10]
+prompt: String
}
class QuizService <<Java control>> {
+create(userId: UUID, request: QuizRequest): AcceptedQuiz
+accept(userId: UUID, id: UUID, request: AcceptQuizRequest): QuizSummary
}
class QuizGenerationJob <<Java job>> {
+execute(quizId: UUID, runId: UUID): JobResult
}
class AiClient <<HTTP adapter>> {
+generate(request: InternalQuizRequest): QuizDraft
}
class QuizGenerator <<Python control>> {
+generate(scope: AuthorizedScope, prompt: String): QuizDraft
}
class QuizValidator <<Python service>> {
+validate(draft: QuizDraft, evidence: EvidenceSet): ValidationResult
}
class QuizDraft <<DTO>> {
+questions: McqSingleQuestion[]
}
class McqSingleQuestion <<DTO>> {
+options: String[4]
+correctOptionIndex: Integer
+explanation: String
+sources: PageCitation[]
}
QuizController ..> QuizRequest
QuizController --> QuizService
QuizService ..> QuizGenerationJob : enqueue
QuizGenerationJob --> AiClient
AiClient ..> QuizGenerator : internal HTTP
QuizGenerator --> QuizValidator
QuizDraft "1" *-- "1..*" McqSingleQuestion
QuizGenerator ..> QuizDraft
note bottom of QuizService
Java sở hữu GENERATING / REVIEW_REQUIRED / READY,
accept / reject / regenerate và scoring.
Python chỉ trả draft hoặc lỗi có cấu trúc.
end note
@enduml
